<title>USA: United Cos Financial Corp Q1 net income rises.</title>
<headline>United Cos Financial Corp Q1 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>BATON ROUGE, La. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.63		    $0.56</p>
<p> Net			 20,158		   17,839</p>
<p> Revs			98,855		   73,290</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  31,873		   31,948</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Shr information is for primary shares.</p>
<p>Net income includes $610,000 from discontinued operations in Q1 1996.  </p>
<p>Company said adoption of FAS 125 added $4.5 million or $0.14 a share to earnings.</p>
</text>
